WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.240
Yusuf grew up in Egypt. He was gentle and kind, clever and eager to learn, and he gained much knowledge.

2
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:13.240
But someone wronged him, and Yusuf was thrown into prison. He did not complain. He waited patiently.

3
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:20.312
In prison, two young men had strange dreams. Yusuf explained their dreams, for Allah had given him understanding.

4
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:28.560
The king also had a strange dream: seven fat cows eaten by seven thin cows, and green ears of grain and dry ones.

5
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:39.232
Yusuf said, Seven good years will be followed by seven years of famine. Store grain in the good years. The king freed him and put him in charge of the storehouses.

6
00:00:39.632 --> 00:00:46.232
When the famine came, his brothers came to Egypt to buy grain. Yusuf recognized them at once, and forgave them.

7
00:00:46.632 --> 00:00:54.672
At last the whole family was together again in Egypt. Patience and forgiveness. Allah's plan is always the most beautiful.
